# Quality gates

Follow root [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

When adding or changing features/behavior:

1. Update or add tests in the same change.
2. Update docs (`docs/bot-protocol.md`, README, `RulesPanel`) when rules, protocol, or UX change.
3. Before finishing: `bun run typecheck` and `bun test` (prefer `bun run check`).

Do not leave tests or docs as follow-ups.
